     "title": "Article 1 ",
     "description": "<p>\r\nThe phrase \"Ministry of Labour\" shall be substituted for the phrase \"Ministry of Labour and Social Affairs\" as stated in Articles (<a href='/legislations/7d3f2340-8b44-4946-b7bc-2a573a223471?almawadId=4fb2f8cd-f046-44b8-930e-dc59e4f4de03'>1</a>), (<a href='/legislations/7d3f2340-8b44-4946-b7bc-2a573a223471?almawadId=15d01b54-bc6a-4dea-961d-fdbb981b4de1'>3</a>) of <a href='/legislations/7d3f2340-8b44-4946-b7bc-2a573a223471'>Minister of Labour and Social Affairs Decision No. (4) of 2015</a> referred to above.\r\n</p>",
